<p class="eyebrow">The hidden cost of growth</p>
<h2 class="section-title">What happens when every new client adds more manual work?</h2>
<p class="section-copy">
            Every new company store, catalog and approval chain adds purchase orders, invoices and shipping updates your team has to chase. For promotional products distributors, manual work is the hidden cost of growth.
          </p>
</header>
<div aria-label="An astronaut pushing against a leaning wall of manual work" class="pain-clean-visual pain-clean-visual--illustration" data-reveal="">
<div class="pain-clean-illustration-frame">
<img alt="Illustration of an astronaut pushing a leaning stack labeled artwork approvals, supplier coordination, purchase orders, status chasing, and manual follow up." decoding="async" fetchpriority="low" height="645" loading="lazy" src="/assets/inline/home-growth-pain-1af865f247.webp" width="860"/>
</div>
</div>
