<div aria-label="Operational scalability questions" class="pain-question-grid">
<article class="pain-question-card" data-reveal="">
<span>01</span>
<h3>How much time does your team spend moving the same order between systems?</h3>
<p>Orders, artwork, purchase orders, invoices, and tracking should not require repeated manual entry.</p>
</article>
<article class="pain-question-card" data-reveal="">
<span>02</span>
<h3>What happens when the person who understands the workflow is unavailable?</h3>
<p>When the process lives inside someone’s head, growth creates dependency instead of resilience.</p>
</article>
<article class="pain-question-card" data-reveal="">
<span>03</span>
<h3>Could your operation handle 20 more company stores without adding more people?</h3>
<p>If every new program adds the same administration, the business is growing, but the operation is not scaling.</p>
</article>
